SUMMARY:18th Annual Penguin Plunge'n Paddle at Juana's
LOCATION:Juana's Pagodas & Sailors' Grill\, 1451 Navarre Beach Causeway\, N
 avarre Beach\, FL 32566
DESCRIPTION:Friday 1/1 · 9 AM\n\nJuana's hosts the 18th Annual Penguin Plu
 nge'n Paddle on New Year's Day from 9 AM to 4 PM. Participants dash from t
 he beach into Santa Rosa Sound\, take a stand-up paddle lap\, or cheer fro
 m the sand. The day supports the Gulf Coast Kiln Walk Society and its cera
 mic arts education work. Raffle tickets run 5 for $20 in advance or 4 for 
 $20 on the day.\n\nPrice: from $36.22\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures
 .com/events/ev-juanas-penguin-plunge-n-paddle-0101.html
