SUMMARY:9th Annual Pirate Plunge at Navarre Beach
LOCATION:Navarre Beach\, starting at Andy D's\, Navarre Beach\, FL 32566 (s
 tarting point at Andy D's)
DESCRIPTION:Friday 1/1 · 12 PM\n\nPirates on the Panhandle\, a Florida non
 profit\, runs its 9th Annual Pirate Plunge into the Gulf at noon on New Ye
 ar's Day. Local officials are invited to take the plunge with everyone els
 e. An after-plunge Pirate Party follows until 3 PM with the Rowdies Rock B
 and\, food and drink for wristband holders\, and a 50/50 raffle. Proceeds 
 support Shadows of Strength.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleve
 ntures.com/events/ev-navarre-pirate-plunge-0101.html
