SUMMARY:Flora-Bama Beach Run for America's Warriors
LOCATION:Flora-Bama\, 17401 Perdido Key Dr\, Perdido Key\, FL 32507
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 3/13\n\nThe 14th annual Flora-Bama Beach Run and Walk 
 starts and ends at the bar and runs entirely on the sand. Five-kilometer r
 unners head into Alabama and half marathoners head into Florida. All regis
 tration fees go to the Special Operations Warrior Foundation.\n\nPrice: fr
 om $30\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-florabama-beach-
 run-warriors-0313.html
